<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Arterial Vascular gained 1 to 25-7/8.</p>
</text>
